  <item>
    <title>D35幕/虽然摆烂还是要追剧。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c006b72d318777c92ea358</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c006b72d318777c92ea358</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Mar 2026 15:15:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【推剧】【盘点】这是一期大家都在催我们做的一期影视剧盘点！！！我们终于把它做出来了，但由于我们去年过于摆烂，其实看的也不是很多，但我们推荐大家的都是我们非常喜欢的剧，这期就是BG剧泰剧日剧加综艺大杂烩，希望大家食用愉快！！！（内含剧透哦！！！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> 潘潘看了好多遍的《修学旅行》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 超绝体型差《if世界开始恋爱 》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> 深得黄黄好评的泰剧《Shine》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">24:21</a> 今年黄黄看的的BG剧《念无双》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1727">28:47</a> 黄黄潘潘一致推荐的《骄阳似我》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">32:02</a> 两部超绝推理英剧《喜鹊谋杀案》《月光花谋杀案》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> 好看！好看爽爽爽的！《喜人奇妙夜2》</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的剧：日剧：《修学旅行我被分到不熟的小组》 《if世界的恋爱》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;中剧：《吾岸》 《念无双》 《骄阳似我》《在你眉梢种红豆》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;泰剧：《Shine》 《黄金血》《理智一点Thee先生》《谁说他们是宿敌》《四方极爱2》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;英剧：《喜鹊谋杀案》 《月光花谋杀案》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;综艺：《喜人奇妙夜2》</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家食用愉快</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM 《トレモロ》-原因在自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@两个碎嘴子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大黄/潘潘</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoCfL8xYeHb9xe2ehocypa-O-s33.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgp1xvVZuw6bQYtCvWMePyP4-DiC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtzAvPlYYawiMjPufGNVmEATW2yu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmmpqnaLtK-ehYmp0Vk6an9dSqII.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnggRiP2v67tWp43zvHhCqntidBT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNB96YvRUYmur7w07bWKnnGDCZ2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlUhe8QDMoztprfJbggWxoDeDOd4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
