  <item>
    <title>D31幕 / 《Mansuang》一场来自泰国的奇幻冒险</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e3ff286144a933b1eccf2d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e3ff286144a933b1eccf2d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Mar 2024 04:40:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【推剧】【泰】今天和大家聊一下MileApo主演的历史向多元文化融合的奇幻电影</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Mansuang》（情牵浮生戏）。主打一个安利加剧情讨论，这是一部很让人惊喜的电影，在这里你可以看到很多泰国传统文化，有很多值得讨论的剧情和设定，有血有泪有家国有希望。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（我们的主演迈波更是！化学反应超好品！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 正片开始 浅浅介绍一下这剧电影</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">5:02</a> 有些人，住定演不了兄弟</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">7:50</a> 剧透开始！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">8:15</a> 坎姆（khem）的人设 一个“不洁“的底层的平民舞者</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 查特拉（chat）的人设 象征着国家的未来与希望 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> 阿万（wan）的存在真的有点多余，好癫的一个人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 程 作为本电影“最大的反派” 虽然活该 但其实反而充斥着悲剧色彩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 大象打架时，草一定会被踩扁。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a> mansuang算是泰国电影的一种新尝试，迈波走出了一条无人走的路</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 谁敢说小舞者和小鼓手没有一腿！他俩的暧昧都要直接扑我脸上了！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2007">33:27</a> 一些些吐槽</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a> 主播打起来了！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtPTN8TVjZ7tIVR_oxC03jRwIMD3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk8DSvWfeWkILvO-vlzXHcG1sPto.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAHJOiCQsu_t3eXCPLJYMKuLLY5.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpmoY_fnxJO1TBxpGMhNPfpJM7GV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foo8yuFRW_3VsPb4yAWwLz_gzD4W.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgnevstReIFAVdHRvzCKRMSmfJMd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpkSZCA5WmXfohltwaojzXhiAVfe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@两个碎嘴子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Cocktail - 藏 (cáng) (Orginal Soundtrack ManSuang)</span></p><span></span><p><span>光宗信吉-悲哀</span></p><span></span><p><span>灵空音乐 - 皇家萌卫</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大黄/潘潘</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkHzlsz9Vx6LbD_MdPjfvLilL-wb.m4a" length="69864545" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnMzdFTS1FaXI3VnFuRlJ1Tlh1QmdBc2thYXYucG5n.png"/>
