  <item>
    <title>D26幕 / 《爱的香气》民国穿越之温柔少爷俏管家</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6506ecab5c88d241261b67b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6506ecab5c88d241261b67b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Sep 2023 12:10:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【推剧】【泰】 终于啊！！！！！！！！！心心念念的《爱的香气》在潘潘的不断期盼中上线了！！！！！！！！穿越三生三世的民国情缘，温柔少爷和小白兔建筑师的设定超级带感，少爷对钟儿温柔的要溢出的情意，两个人的那种拉扯感，苏感upup！！有木有！！！！！都给我看！！！！！都给我看《爱的香气》！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">1:05</a> 爱的香气的简单介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">7:33</a> 少爷那拿得出手的爱！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">9:12</a> 电视剧的亮点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a> 我们的小吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a> 和原著的一些不同</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsLTfS7-oHZPo3dWS9dVOlz4YRuN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FugYR8wK1uxgfynBtTAvlgSQuNXa.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJu1P03j-SnxYcg5eyf-6EAk5Mr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSzNyfontKCBMxS4rU4JU5dlgQG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>醉翁之意不在酒，醉于慕情，</span></p><span></span><p><span>何故竭绝蒹葭之思？</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽酩酊，迄侵晨残酒便消，</span></p><span></span><p><span>可此醉心之情，暮夜复复反反。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：ASIA7 - จอมขวัญ (เพลงประกอบซีรีส์ หอมกลิ่นความรัก)</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cocktail - ลั่นทม (เพลงประกอบละคร หอมกลิ่นความรัก)</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;祖海 - 好运来</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@两个碎嘴子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大黄 / 潘潘</span></p>]]></description>
