    <guid isPermaLink="false">643d53f89361a4e7c3ca0651</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Apr 2023 14:13:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>特此推出手绘头像活动！（详情评论区）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《两个碎嘴子》一岁啦！非常感谢大家这一年来的陪伴！希望未来的一年也可以更多的为大家带去快乐！希望节目越来越好！也祝大家越来越好！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">2:10</a>拖延的原因</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">2:57</a>一年以来的变化</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a>未来一年我们的愿望</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a>再来一年争取不摆烂</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="718">11:58</a>节目的素材都是怎么来的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a>关于我们追黑帮少爷的后续</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>讨好型人格这一期的良好的反响和大家的鼓励</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a>快乐哒小事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a>关于潘潘磕cp的后续</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a>黄黄和潘潘感谢大家的一些话</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a>画重点号！黄黄的画头像抽奖活动！请大家积极参与！小福利！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">41:47</a>最后总结还是感谢大家！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【选项一】黑白简约小头像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlWvn9xNzaqSYacHdTJ5ASGyLkg1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fke6qnwLAurCZnYu1y9_VWFh7oAa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【选项二】潦草彩色小头像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjNGHHUaNFcBR9LE8KzGDyjMca5Z.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@两个碎嘴子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大黄 / 潘潘</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG:爱意(金风玉露变奏) / 陈致逸</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;生日祝福歌 / 格格</span></p>]]></description>
