  <item>
    <title>D23幕 / 恋爱脑是病！得治！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/641589938aca9099d7ad0fc2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">641589938aca9099d7ad0fc2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Mar 2023 09:51:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>请大家切记恋爱是重要的但他不是全部！！从尘埃里开出的不一定漂亮的花！还是那苦了吧唧的狗尾巴草！救赎自己的不是别人是你自己啊！请你千千万万次救自己与水火！愿你快乐！美丽！聪慧！但不要恋爱脑！建议恋爱脑加入医保！恋爱脑是病要治啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 正片开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">1:29</a>黄黄和潘潘认知当中的恋爱脑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">1:59</a>我们身边的恋爱脑的故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">7:28</a>抓马的恋爱脑八卦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> 首要任务不是爱情是保护好自己</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a>黄黄朋友那同学校的异地恋</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a>低到尘埃里的爱情不能开出鲜花</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">22:56</a>爱情与她而言是救赎，是光是一切吗?</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a>黄黄和潘潘对恋爱的看法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a>请你们千千万万次救自己于水火</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a>良性关系是相互尊重与平等</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2167">36:07</a>兄弟们姐妹们！我们的首要任务是搞钱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a>祝大家拥有甜甜的恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@两个碎嘴子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播： 大黄 / 潘潘</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BMG: 《爱人错过》/ 告五人</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《钢琴版何以笙箫默》 / 苏赜</span></p>]]></description>
