  <item>
    <title>D22幕 / 《深海》究竟值不值得看？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63dfbe260d7e8eaa72fbed61</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63dfbe260d7e8eaa72fbed61</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Feb 2023 14:33:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近关于《深海》这部电影的网评还蛮两极化的，今天我们就来作为两个普通观众，聊一聊我们的观后感。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 正片开始</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">1:39</a> 特效真的超美！已经值回票钱了！首创粒子水墨特效！绝！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">2:41</a> 网上差评主要集中在前半段剧情拖沓，其实细节超多，而且前半段更倾向于一个情绪输出。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">6:11</a> 看完电影觉得有被治愈到～</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">8:33</a> 总得来说还是推荐大家看，可能不是那么完美，但绝对不是依托答辩。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">9:37</a> 田晓鹏导演真的是一个坚持初心的动画人，值得敬佩。</span><br><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 从这里开始的内容涉及剧透！】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> 一刷记忆点集中在了南河身上。南河劈开大概得那一瞬间仿佛看到了当年大圣那一棒。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 得知一切是梦的时候，那一瞬间有被无语住哈哈，但是很快就释怀了。梦的力量是永远存在的。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 二刷带着细节再去看，就会有一种全新的体验。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 二刷时记忆点集中在了参宿。原来劈开深海的，不止南河一个，此刻的小参宿也在努力。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1019">16:59</a> 南河像一道光出现在参宿的世界里。自己都没活明白，却总想逞英雄。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 南河的形象其实是随着参宿的梦在变化。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> 南河也有抑郁症。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> 南河的建模和大圣其实是同一个。南河是没有铠甲披风的英雄。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1367">22:47</a> 其实导演刚开始就暗示了是一场梦。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a> 海精灵其实就是参宿的执念，最开始是妈妈临行前发丝飞扬的侧影，后来逐渐变成了南河。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 丧气鬼其实只是想抱抱参宿，它就是红卫衣，它既是保护，也是恐惧。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1696">28:16</a> 爸爸是阿金，继母是阿花，弟弟是糖豆儿。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1789">29:49</a> 参宿和南河的名字来源于两颗恒星，参宿四与南河三，参宿四也被称为“不死的星星”，南河三也永远守护在参宿四旁边。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1874">31:14</a> 一见生财和您可来了是取自黑白无常帽子上的字。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> 小海獭们唱《小白船》其实是安魂曲。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2039">33:59</a> 关于结局，一千个人心中有一千个哈姆雷特吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@两个碎嘴子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大黄 / 潘潘</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM： &nbsp;星尘 (《深海》片尾曲) / </span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/singer/001csBdA0LIy0y" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/singer/001csBdA0LIy0y"><span>周昭妍</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>星尘（伴奏） / 《深海》电影原声带</span></p><span></span><p><span>再见深海（微亮的瞬间） / 唐汉霄</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgOIvf69LjcqsNKX6iMzSRWMhTBS.m4a" length="59648005" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnew4IMc0A3UGAWGRu8nN8741MKb.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>D21幕 / 惊！童年糗事大揭秘！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ce88b778910ae65cc34d25</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ce88b778910ae65cc34d25</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Jan 2023 13:16:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人的童年能有多离谱！？走过路过不要错过！</span></p><span></span><p><span>童年囧事多，离谱的事更多，离谱小潘和大黄，童年的我们到底干了多少离谱的事！今天我们就来放下脸面，来给大家讲讲这些丢脸往事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期欢乐含量：100%！ &nbsp;希望大家听完可以从头哈到尾！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">0:13</a> 正片开始</span></p><span></span><p><span>【潘潘别名无敌破坏王】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">1:20</a> 火烧刘海！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">2:40</a> 玻璃球塞鼻孔！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">3:59</a> 徒手摸漏电台灯！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">6:22</a> 拿金属捅插座！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">7:20</a> 在家玩火又玩水！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">8:27</a> 潘潘家具克星实锤！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">9:31</a> 被坐蹋的床</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 上山烤土豆烤地瓜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 上山遇见坟包</span></p><span></span><p><span>【大黄命大的童年】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 放学从楼梯上飞下去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1076">17:56</a> 被汽车从脚上碾过去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 被自行车撞倒在地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 有门不走非翻栏杆，给大腿划条大血口子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> 怕黑给膝盖摔全是血</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a> 二人牙齿掉茬经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 铁头撞坏门 身破消防栓 屁坐拖布把</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1699">28:19</a> 反手锁自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博@两个碎嘴子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大黄 / 潘潘</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM： 大风车 / &nbsp;中央人民广播电台少年儿童合唱团</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bygone Bumps &nbsp;/ Deep East Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>快乐小神仙 / 天唱组合</span></p>]]></description>
